  "id": "feature-attention",
  "term": "feature attention",
  "definition": "Feature attention is a person’s focus on particular features of a stimulus while making a judgment or trying to tell items apart. In this source, it refers specifically to which linguistic features listeners notice and use in real time when identifying or locating accents.",
